* WEBCON CFG - copy to WEBCON CFG A and edit on the guest.
* Parsed as KEY VALUE lines. '*' and blank lines ignored.
* Do not commit real passwords.
*
* Auth: set PASSHASH (preferred) or PASS (plaintext, isolated LAN only).
* PASSHASH format: FNV1A:<8-hex> over CMS EBCDIC bytes. Not cryptographic.
* Generate on CMS: WEBCONSR HASH <password>
PORT 8080
BIND INADDR_ANY
USERID webuser
PASSHASH FNV1A:00000000
SESSION_TTL 1800
MAX_BODY 4096
MAX_OUT 16384
MAX_FAIL 5
LOCKOUT_SEC 300
AUDIT_MAX 2000
LOGFILE WEBCONS LOG A
UIFILE WEBCONS HTML A
AUDITFILE WEBCONS AUDIT A
ALLOW QUERY *
ALLOW INDICATE *
ALLOW LISTFILE *
ALLOW TYPE *
ALLOW FIND *
ALLOW GREP *
ALLOW NETSTAT *
DENY CP IPL *
DENY CP SYSTEM *
DENY DIRECTXA *
DENY FORMAT *
DENY LOGOFF *
DENY SHUTDOWN *
